  "body_html": "<p>Embrace the cozy warmth of the holiday season with the Cardinal Quilt by Jeminise. Featuring a beautifully detailed vintage illustration design of two cardinals resting on holly branches, this quilt set adds a perfect touch of festive charm and rustic warmth to your guest bedroom, vacation home, or cozy cabin setup. Designed for both indoor and outdoor comfort, it serves as a versatile layer that brings festive cheer to your home during the winter holidays and all year round.</p>\n<h3>Key Features</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Customizable Design:</strong> Personalize your quilt with custom text options and complete your bedding set with optional matching pillowcases.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Soft &amp; Breathable Comfort:</strong> Constructed with a soft, breathable polyester outer layer and filled with high-quality silk floss for lightweight, consecutive warmth.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Versatile Use:</strong> Perfect as a cozy bed quilt, a comfortable picnic mat, a couch throw blanket, or a reliable companion for camping trips.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Available Sizes:</strong> Offered in a versatile range of sizes including Throw (60x70 inches), Twin (68x86 inches), Full (80x90 inches), Queen (90x90 inches), and King (102x91 inches).</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Conveniently machine washable in cold water; dries quickly on a low-heat or air-dry cycle, fluffing up beautifully after every wash.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Product Specifications</h3>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Quilt Set</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Color</th>\n<td>Xmas Couple Red Bird</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Style</th>\n<td>Animal</td>\n</tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Bird</td>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>Patchwork</td>\n<th>Seasons</th>\n<td>Winter</td>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n<tr>\n<th>Recommended Uses for Product</th>\n<td>Camping</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>",
